WEBVTT

00:06:27.454 --> 00:06:32.329
And she always communicated to us that
sense of of wonder and love and light

00:06:32.329 --> 00:06:36.871
and the beautiful things. But we were
living in a house that was, you know,

00:06:36.871 --> 00:06:40.538
frankly, terrifying. My father
was violent and abusive.

00:06:40.538 --> 00:06:42.329
He was emotionally abusive to all of us.

00:06:42.496 --> 00:06:47.079
He was physically violent to my
mother to an extreme degree.

00:06:47.954 --> 00:06:49.954
And we were terrified of him.

00:06:49.954 --> 00:06:53.746
And also, you know, we witnessed I
witnessed my brother and sister and

00:06:53.746 --> 00:06:56.204
I all witnessed horrifying things,

00:06:56.246 --> 00:07:00.704
things that I that I never witnessed
beyond that, you know, as an adult.